T200	Quotation 38032 38047	"Are you here?"
T201	Entity 38048 38051	she
T202	Entity 37973 37976	him
T203	Cue 38052 38056	said
T204	Quotation 38058 38144	"And we have been looking and looking for you. . . . But what is the matter with you?"
T205	Entity 38145 38148	she
T206	Cue 38149 38154	asked
T207	Quotation 38229 38262	"How strange you are, Andryusha!"
T208	Quotation 38263 38285	"I am pleased, Tanya,"
T209	Cue 38286 38290	said
T210	Entity 38291 38297	Kovrin
T211	Quotation 38333 38473	"I am more than pleased: I am happy. Tanya, darling Tanya, you are an extraordinary, nice creature. Dear Tanya, I am so glad, I am so glad!"
T212	Entity 38474 38476	He
T213	Entity 38489 38492	her
T214	Quotation 38522 38912	"I have just passed through an exalted, wonderful, unearthly moment. But I can't tell you all about it or you would call me mad and not believe me. Let us talk of you. Dear, delightful Tanya! I love you, and am used to loving you. To have you near me, to meet you a dozen times a day, has become a necessity of my existence; I don't know how I shall get on without you when I go back home."
T215	Entity 38318 38321	her
T216	Entity 38178 38181	his
T217	Quotation 38913 38918	"Oh,"
T218	Cue 38919 38926	laughed
T219	Entity 38927 38932	Tanya
T220	Quotation 38934 39019	"you will forget about us in two days. We are humble people and you are a great man."
T221	Quotation 39020 39049	"No; let us talk in earnest!"
T222	Entity 39050 39052	he
T223	Cue 39053 39057	said
T224	Quotation 39059 39139	"I shall take you with me, Tanya. Yes? Will you come with me? Will you be mine?"
T225	Quotation 39140 39147	"Come,"
T226	Cue 39148 39152	said
T227	Entity 39153 39158	Tanya
T228	Quotation 39360 39418	"I was not thinking of it . . . I was not thinking of it,"
T229	Entity 39419 39422	she
T230	Cue 39423 39427	said
T231	Quotation 39547 39664	"I want a love that will dominate me altogether; and that love only you, Tanya, can give me. I am happy! I am happy!"
T232	Quotation 39823 39843	"How lovely she is!"
T233	Entity 39665 39668	She
T234	Entity 39765 39767	he
T235	Cue 39794 39821	expressed his rapture aloud
