T310	Quotation 53659 53708	"I believe it is time for you to have your milk,"
T311	Entity 53709 53714	Tanya
T312	Cue 53715 53719	said
T313	Entity 53723 53734	her husband
T314	Quotation 53736 53766	"No, it is not time yet . . ."
T315	Entity 53767 53769	he
T316	Cue 53770 53774	said
T317	Quotation 53809 53846	"Drink it yourself; I don't want it."
T318	Entity 53847 53852	Tanya
T319	Cue 53902 53906	said
T320	Quotation 53926 53972	"You notice yourself that milk does you good."
T321	Quotation 53973 54001	"Yes, a great deal of good!"
T322	Entity 54002 54008	Kovrin
T323	Cue 54009 54016	laughed
T324	Quotation 54018 54085	"I congratulate you: I have gained a pound in weight since Friday."
T325	Cue 54131 54135	said
T326	Entity 54086 54088	He
T327	Quotation 54147 54727	"Why, why have you cured me? Preparations of bromide, idleness, hot baths, supervision, cowardly consternation at every mouthful, at every step-- all this will reduce me at last to idiocy. I went out of my mind, I had megalomania; but then I was cheerful, confident, and even happy; I was interesting and original. Now I have become more sensible and stolid, but I am just like every one else: I am-- mediocrity; I am weary of life. . . . Oh, how cruelly you have treated me! . . . I saw hallucinations, but what harm did that do to any one? I ask, what harm did that do any one?"
T328	Quotation 54728 54765	"Goodness knows what you are saying!"
T329	Cue 54766 54772	sighed
T330	Entity 54773 54789	Yegor Semyonitch
T331	Quotation 54791 54835	"It's positively wearisome to listen to it."
T332	Quotation 54836 54856	"Then don't listen."
